# Implementation Plan - AI Risk Manager: Return Risk Scorer

We will build a full-stack, end-to-end Machine Learning system and modern web dashboard for predicting e-commerce order return risks using the 200,000 training order dataset and generating predictions on the 50,000 test order dataset.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Dataset Structure Confirmed**:
> - `train.csv`: 200,000 rows with 15 input features + `returned` target (0 or 1).
> - `test.csv`: 50,000 rows with 15 input features (held-out test set for batch predictions).
> - Features include customer history (`past_purchase_count`, `past_return_rate`), product info (`product_price`, `product_rating`, `product_category`), order info (`discount_percent`, `delivery_delay_days`, `session_length_minutes`, `num_product_views`, `device_type`, `shipping_method`, `payment_method`, `used_coupon`), and unique `order_id`.

> [!NOTE]
> **Threshold Cost Optimization**:
> Rather than locking to a fixed 0.5 probability threshold, the system automatically computes financial trade-offs (e.g. ₹20 FP manual review cost vs ₹500 FN missed return loss) to find the profit-maximizing risk threshold for e-commerce merchants.

