## Proposed Changes

### 1. Data Processing & Feature Engineering (`src/`)

#### [NEW] [`src/data_loader.py`](file:///c:/Users/Parth/OneDrive/Desktop/Project2/src/data_loader.py)
- Load `train.csv` and `test.csv`.
- Create standardized Train/Validation/Test split (70% train, 15% validation, 15% internal test) from `train.csv`.

#### [NEW] [`src/feature_engineering.py`](file:///c:/Users/Parth/OneDrive/Desktop/Project2/src/feature_engineering.py)
- Encode categorical features (`device_type`, `product_category`, `shipping_method`, `payment_method`).
- Construct domain features:
  - `expected_returns`: `past_purchase_count * past_return_rate`
  - `discount_amount`: `product_price * (discount_percent / 100)`
  - `effective_price`: `product_price - discount_amount`
  - `view_to_session_ratio`: `num_product_views / (session_length_minutes + 1)`
  - `delay_severity`: positive vs negative `delivery_delay_days`
  - Category-level return risk encoding
- Flag exception cases: `insufficient_history` (`past_purchase_count <= 2` or `num_product_views < 3`).

